  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="5a51fc79-4889-55b1-aecc-e9994161712e" activityNameId="8498bd5b-a821-534d-80ad-aa5508fbab27" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heavy fuel oil, burned in power plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heavy fuel oil, burned in power plant
Estimation of the average European oil power plant.;
Synonyms: Schweröl, HFO; 
UUID: 206d1e35-af8a-3630-8e63-bbef87ba7eeb
All energy use, use of chemicals, emissions to air and water including treatment of flue gasses and effluents.
Location: Estimation for Europe.
Technology: Estimation for average in Europe. There might be large differences for single plants depending on type of flue gas and effluent treatment, situation at the site concerning compartment of emissions, necessity of chemicals for operation.
Time period: Regulated emissions like CO2, NOx, SOx, particles, etc. have been assessed with new data from literature, environmental reports and questionnaires. Other data steam from older literature sources.
Production volume: Total electricity production in RER oil power plants was about 200TWh in 2000.
Sampling: Literature, environmental reports and questionnaires 
Extrapolations: From data for single plants to European average.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_206d1e35-af8a-3630-8e63-bbef87ba7eeb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">RER</shortname>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Location: Estimation for Europe.</text>
        </comment>
      </geography>
      <technology>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Technology: Estimation for average in Europe. There might be large differences for single plants depending on type of flue gas and effluent treatment, situation at the site concerning compartment of emissions, necessity of chemicals for operation.</text>
        </comment>
      </technology>
      <timePeriod startDate="2000-01-01" endDate="2000-12-31" isDataValidForEntirePeriod="true">
        <comment>
